Package: yabe-avalonia
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Vicente Pinto <vpinto@aura-myc.com>
Description: BACnet device browser and diagnostic tool
 Cross-platform port of YABE (Yet Another BACnet Explorer) using
 Avalonia UI. Supports BACnet/IP, IPv6, MSTP, PTP and Ethernet
 discovery, COV subscriptions, trend logs, alarms, schedules
 and more.
Homepage: https://github.com/vinpinto/yabe-avalonia
Depends: libx11-6, libfontconfig1
Installed-Size: 73700
